  "uncertain": [
    "The two images assign different signals to the same pads (image 1: GPIO29 and NC/GPIO14 on the left, GPIO28/27/26/25 with SDIO on the right; image 2: those pads are NC and NC/GPIO14 moves to the right header). They look like two module variants of the same board; which applies to this record is not settled by the images."
  ],
  "notes": "Labels are the outer callout names; silkscreen numbers beside each pad (4, TX, G, 5V, NC*) placed first in functions. Bottom pad on each header has only the silkscreen NC and no callout, recorded as NC. MDTI copied as printed. 5V0 read with digit 0 (voltage)."
